{"sourceUrl":"https://wgyxy.hhu.edu.cn/2026/0615/c6684a327973/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:51.968494+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://wgyxy.hhu.edu.cn/2026/0615/c6684a327973/page.htm","html":"<div><div><div><p><br/></p></div><p><span><span><span><span><span>河海大学外国语学院前身为</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1987</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年创办的外语系，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1995</span></span><span><span><span><span>年与社科系、法律系等组建人文学院，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2002</span></span><span><span><span><span>年成立外国语学院。现拥有外国语言文学一级学科硕士学位授权点、翻译硕士学位授权点，英语本科专业、法语本科专业</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>英语第二学士学位专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>和“全球胜任力与数字生态文明建设”微专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>。英语专业入选国家一流本科专业建设点和江苏省品牌专业。西非国家经济共同体研究中心获教育部国别与区域研究基地备案。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>为让更多优秀考生更深入地了解我单位特色与优势，各学科实力、师资力量、研究生教育情况和研究生招生信息等，我单位将于</span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>3-4</span></span><span><span><span>日期间举办校园开放日活动。活动期间，我单位将进行研究生招生政策宣讲、与导师面对面交流互动等活动，提供详尽的报考信息和指导。欢迎有意向报考我单位研究生的同学前来参加，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、活动规模及活动对象</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本次活动规模拟定</span></span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span><span>名左右，具体专业详见报名系统，报名条件如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span>高水平大学或设有特色专业全日制高校的本科三年级在校生（</span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span>届毕业生）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 3.</span></span><span><span><span>有意来河海大学求学深造，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关学术研究或实践工作。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>二、报名时间及方式</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>请有意向申请我单位校园开放日的同学于北</span></span><span><span><span>京时间</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>8:00—2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>17:00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>在河海大学研究生招生管理系统（考生端）（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"http://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/</a></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）中</span></span></span><span><span>，招生项目选择“全国优秀大学生校园开放日”进行注册、登录和信息填报（具体操作详见系统提示），不在规定时间内填报的所有报名信息均无效。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>三、材料提交与确认</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>参加我单位校园开放日的同学，需提供以下材料</span></span><span><span><strong>（</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>请按照顺序扫描成</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>文件，汇总生成一个压缩包，命名方式：报名专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>_</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>报名姓名</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>_</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>校园开放日报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>.ZIP</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>，上传至报名系统）</strong></span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span><span>参加现场活动时请携带</span></span></span><span><span>身份证、学生证、学校教务部门盖章成绩单（含总评成绩、排名）</span></span><span><span><span><strong>原件备查</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）“</span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生校园开放日报名登记表”</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份（请至报名系统生成和下载）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>）前两年半成绩单与总评成绩、排名证明</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>）学术或科研成果、各类获奖证书扫描件各</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>）国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或</span></span></span><span><span>IELTS/TOEFL</span></span><span><span><span>成绩，或</span></span></span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span><span><span><span>成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明材料</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span>其他能证明个人能力的材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>我单位将对提交的报名信息进行审核后确定入围开放日活动对象。</span></span><span><span><span>请提交报名申请的同学于北京时间</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>29</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>12:00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>前登录报名系统查询审核状态，入围者请于北京时间</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>12:00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>前，在报名系统中点击确认参加，逾期未确认参加者视作放弃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>四、活动方式及具体安排</strong></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>序号</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>时间</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>内容</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>备注</strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>15:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>开放日报到，提交报名材料</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>行政楼</span></span></span><span><span>602</span></span><span><span><span>室</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>9:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院开幕式</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span><span><span><span><span>学院及学科情况介绍</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>行政楼</span></span></span><span><span>105</span></span><span><span><span>室</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><br/>9:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>名师报告：为什么在</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>时代，英语能力反而更重要？</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>行政楼</span></span></span><span><span>105</span></span><span><span><span>室</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><br/>10:00</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>名师报告：人工智能辅助翻译的译后编辑效能研究</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>行政楼</span></span></span><span><span>105</span></span><span><span><span>室</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><spa