>16:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>导师团队圆桌派对</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>行政楼</span></span></span><span><span>602</span></span><span><span><span>室、</span></span></span><span><span>617</span></span><span><span><span>室、</span></span></span><span><span>621</span></span><span><span><span>室</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><strong>五、其他</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>其他未尽事宜请参见单位官网通知，最终招生</span></span><span><span>单位</span></span><span><span>、专业、方向和导师以</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年博士、硕士研究生招生简章和专业目录公布信息为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span>开放日待遇：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）差旅、食宿：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>开放日当天提供工作餐，凡是参加我单位校园开放日，后续推免或者一志愿被我校录取的外校应届考生，给予一定的往返交通、住宿费补贴。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）保险：单位将为参加校园开放日的同学购买开放日期间人身意外伤害保险。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 3.</span></span><span><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：钱老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span><span><span>025-58099462</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span>wyyym@hhu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>通信地址：江苏省南京市江宁区佛城西路</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>号河海大学行政</span></span></span></span><span><span>楼</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>                                    <span>外国语学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>                                  2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><s